not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-034-yanghu-ws2567662-rendered-comparison"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-jin034-liu-shan-literal","person_id":"o5j_33i_jkf","surname":"劉","ming":"禪","hao":null,"title":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p018","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p018:m0174","source_anchor":{"start":174,"end":176,"surface":"劉禪"},"quote":"夫適道之論，皆未應權，是故謀之雖多，而決之欲獨。凡以險阻得存者，謂所敵者同，力足自固。苟其輕重不齊，強弱異勢，則智士不能謀，而險阻不可保也。蜀之為國，非不險也，高山尋雲霓，深谷肆無景，束馬懸車，然後得濟，皆言一夫荷戟，千人莫當。及進兵之日，曾無籓籬之限，斬將搴旗，伏屍數萬，乘勝席捲，徑至成都，漢中諸城，皆鳥棲而不敢出。非皆無戰心，誠力不足相抗。至劉禪降服，諸營堡者索然俱散。今江淮之難，不過劍閣；山川之險，不過岷漢；孫皓之暴，侈于劉禪；吳人之困，甚于巴蜀。而大晉兵眾，多於前世；資儲器械，盛於往時；今不于此平吳，而更阻兵相守，征夫苦役，日尋干戈，經歷盛衰，不可長久，宜當時定，以一四海。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-034","source_id":"s-jinshu-034-yanghu-ws2567662-rendered-comparison"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p018:m0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"劉禪","kind":"person","person_id":"o5j_33i_jkf","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p018:m0216","start":216,"e